error[E0202]: expected '{' after 'new with(...)'
 --> $DIR/no-braces.nra:4:26
  |
4 | let copy = new with(user);
  |                          ^ expected '{', found ';'
  |
  = help: a copy lists its replacements in braces, which may be empty: 'new with(source) { }'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0202`.
